            "detailed_description": "<h1>Success!</h1><p>So, after a critical bug in the game was finally fixed, we got things running normally again. We did have to remove some of the polish on the game to clear up the bug (such as death animations and smooth screen transitions) but, we will be re-integrating these this week!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Silentium 2D, a local, sharedscreen game which pits you and a friend (soon to be enemy) against eachother in 1v1 arcade combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was originally made as a High School test project. Certainly not a fully fledged game but there's still some fun to be had on a single keyboard with a friend.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Silentium 2D, a local, sharedscreen game which pits you and a friend (soon to be enemy) against eachother in 1v1 arcade combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was originally made as a High School test project. Certainly not a fully fledged game but there's still some fun to be had on a single keyboard with a friend.</p>",
